{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >only bagels can move the ball properly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >whoever scores the most goals within 5 minutes wins the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play 1v1 or 2v2, on a variety of maps (currently 4, i plan for more)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >utilise the unique physics properties of the bagels to propel yourself across the map, as well as the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >use the practice mode to get to grips with the unique movement system within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lobby browser makes it easy to set up a match with your friends, or find a match with another player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >join a game before it starts to spectate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >peer-to-peer netcode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bagelball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >left click to pick up bagel/drop bagel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wasd to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shift to sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >scroll wheel to make bagel close and far</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ctrl to fastfall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >right click to quantum switch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >space to jump, space while in the air to double jump, space while on a wall to wall jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >jump onto a bagel underneath you while in close mode to start flying</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"True Bagelball Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3620440/00c6fd797176c7a81f491e0541332d8536735f21.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3620440?t=1771186160","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3620440/445082dc8c08a7434ebbe5843101fdc17d8f2861/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771186160","capsu